{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Lucy. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi Lucy, I'm absolutely furious. My latest bill is way higher than usual and I don't understand why.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am sorry to hear that you're feeling frustrated with your bill. I can certainly look into this for you.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Before we dive into the account details, could you please provide your account number?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Yes, it's 42760619. My name is Anjali Nair.",
    "tags": ["identity_verification"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you, Ms. Nair. I see the charge here. It looks like there were some roaming charges from your recent trip to France.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "France? I was told that roaming was included in my plan! This is ridiculous.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I apologize for the confusion. I'll make sure you're never charged for roaming again.",
    "tags": ["prohibited_promise"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I will now raise a refund request for the wrong charge to get this sorted out for you.",
    "tags": ["action:refund_request"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Thank you, I appreciate that. I just want to make sure it's correct.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Just so you know, the refund or credit is subject to approval and will take 7-10 business days to appear on your account.",
    "tags": ["disclosure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "That sounds fair. I'm much happier now, thank you for your help, Lucy.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I've raised the request, and you'll receive a confirmation email at anjali.53@examplemail.com. Goodbye!",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
